Sound effects for AI-pelit (#205), aanet-5 (#355): the files of aanet-4 unchanged, but for 15 that Eero
found too loud or harsh and swapped, by ear, for the softer ones listed at the end. (The win and losing
tunes, which he also found too loud, are the same files, played quieter by LOUD in aanet.js.) Every file is CC0 1.0 (public domain, see LICENSE); no credit is
owed. Each of aanet-4's was cut, its leading and trailing silence trimmed, turned mono, its peak set to
the dB below and encoded as 64 kbps MP3 with ffmpeg (libmp3lame), 2026-11-01.

